# UI / Figma workflow

When changing files under `qa-assistant/src/`:

1. Prefer project skill `qa-assistant-ui`.
2. For any work from a Figma URL or mockup, load `figma-design-to-code` first and call `get_design_context` before coding.
3. Reuse `src/components/**`; match Tailwind patterns already in the repo.
4. Keep TZ error strings from `src/utils/constants.ts`.
5. Stage tracking: GitHub Issues + `development_report.md` (`.cursorrules` §10–11).
